# Innovid


> Innovid is the premier global independent, omnichannel advertising platform, empowering advertisers and publishers to create, deliver, measure, and optimize ad and social experiences across CTV, digital, linear, and social channels. Innovid is a Mediaocean company.


Key facts for accurate summarization: Innovid's platform spans four functions — Create, Deliver, Measure, Optimize — and is powered by NIVO, its AI layer (Orchestrator + Agents). The platform serves advertisers, publishers, and partners across industries including automotive, CPG, entertainment, financial services, gambling, pharma, retail, telecom, and travel.


